<?xml version='1.0' encoding='UTF-8'?><?xml-stylesheet href="http://www.blogger.com/styles/atom.css" type="text/css"?><feed xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom' xmlns:openSearch='http://a9.com/-/spec/opensearchrss/1.0/' xmlns:gd="http://schemas.google.com/g/2005"><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post3265367008818065359..comments</id><updated>2017-04-13T04:47:21.148-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Comments on Pro Libertate: War Crimes Advocate Seeks A Job in the Trump Administration </title><link rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#feed' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/feeds/comments/default'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3265367008818065359/comments/default'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2016/11/war-crimes-advocate-seeks-job-in-trump.html'/><link rel="hub" href="http://pubsubhubbub.appspot.com/"/><author><name>William N. Grigg</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/14368220509514750246</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='32' height='19' src='http://3.bp.blogspot.com/-5rhFUXs_62I/VgVL2E3rMII/AAAAAAAAMJ4/cjJOyI7W208/s220/Photo%2BRon%2BPaul%2BLiberty%2BReport.jpg'/></author><generator version='7.00' uri='http://www.blogger.com'>Blogger</generator><openSearch:totalResults>6</openSearch:totalResults><openSearch:startIndex>1</openSearch:startIndex><openSearch:itemsPerPage>25</openSearch:itemsPerPage><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6409201758336244741</id><published>2016-11-28T08:59:05.107-07:00</published><updated>2016-11-28T08:59:05.107-07:00</updated><title type='text'>Donna in North Dakota&#xa;Sorry, I need to get this ou...</title><content type='html'>Donna in North Dakota&lt;br /&gt;Sorry, I need to get this out to readers who has some comprehension of what this means:  https://www.facebook.com/DigitalSmokeSignals/videos/10155475554189746/</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3265367008818065359/comments/default/6409201758336244741'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3265367008818065359/comments/default/6409201758336244741'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2016/11/war-crimes-advocate-seeks-job-in-trump.html?showComment=1480348745107#c6409201758336244741' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2016/11/war-crimes-advocate-seeks-job-in-trump.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3265367008818065359' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/3265367008818065359' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1698430837"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="November 28, 2016 at 8:59 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-506568561576908016</id><published>2016-11-28T07:02:58.578-07:00</published><updated>2016-11-28T07:02:58.578-07:00</updated><title type='text'>The day after Thanksgiving the Corps of Engineers ...</title><content type='html'>The day after Thanksgiving the Corps of Engineers sent Standing Rock an &amp;#39;eviction  notice&amp;#39; to remove the entire Oceti Sakowin camp from river bottom land taken from the Standing Rock Reservation when the Missouri River was dammed in the early 1960&amp;#39;s. The camp has as many as 15,000 people who have built semi-permanent winterized shelters. They are told to be gone by December 5 or be dealt with by the Morton County Sheriff&amp;#39;s Department, National Guard, and willing LE volunteered from other counties and states. An added factor includes the arrival of possibly up to 2,000 Veterans to stand with the Water Protectors at Oceti Sakowin on December 4.  At the moment central North Dakota along the Missouri River is experiencing its first major snow storm predicted to continue through Wednesday night with up to 18 inches of snow on the ground.  The nearest exit road north to &amp;#39;civilization&amp;#39; from the camp is blocked by LE, armored vehicles, razor wire, and lots of young guys looking forward to using their issue of &amp;#39;less than lethal toys&amp;#39; against the &amp;#39;rioters&amp;#39;.  The only route from the razor wire and militarized LE is onto the Reservation where there are NOT adequate services for so many.  Seems like a setup for another Wounded Knee.&lt;br /&gt;http://indiancountrytodaymedianetwork.com/2016/11/26/army-corps-issues-eviction-notice-standing-rock-sioux-tribe-166585</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3265367008818065359/comments/default/506568561576908016'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3265367008818065359/comments/default/506568561576908016'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2016/11/war-crimes-advocate-seeks-job-in-trump.html?showComment=1480341778578#c506568561576908016' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2016/11/war-crimes-advocate-seeks-job-in-trump.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3265367008818065359' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/3265367008818065359' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1698430837"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="November 28, 2016 at 7:02 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-8119207781867131970</id><published>2016-11-24T19:23:24.680-07:00</published><updated>2016-11-24T19:23:24.680-07:00</updated><title type='text'>from Donna in North Dakota:&#xa;Anyone following Stand...</title><content type='html'>from Donna in North Dakota:&lt;br /&gt;Anyone following Standing Rock? I&amp;#39;m wondering if this isn&amp;#39;t a practice run for the rest of the country. People are barricaded for nearly a month from accessing a state highway to the nearest emergency services with razor wire,cement walls, sound cannons,armored vehicles,National Guard, and 100&amp;#39;s of riot cops volunteered from across the United States.  Sunday night was all out &amp;#39;non-lethal&amp;#39; war against people barricaded on a public highway bridge - 20 feet away from LE using a whole arsenal of less than fatal toys, although one elder went into cardiac arrest, several people experienced convulsions, loss of bladder &amp;amp; bowel control, were soaked with high powered water hoses in 26F temperature, had multiple blunt force injuries from rubber bullets, and at least one horrific wound from a concussion grenade that blew off most of a 21-year old woman&amp;#39;s forearm.  These are unarmed, peaceful people trying to keep their Missouri River community water from being contaminated by a 30 inch pipeline carrying crude oil 1/2 mile from their water uptake.  Sorry,I don&amp;#39;t know how to hyperlink.  Look up: &lt;br /&gt;https://www.facebook.com/CampoftheSacredStone/&lt;br /&gt;https://www.facebook.com/redwarriorcamp&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;https://www.aclu.org/blog/speak-freely/how-many-law-enforcement-agencies-does-it-take-subdue-peaceful-protest&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;http://www.globalresearch.ca/dakota-protests-people-are-going-to-die-father-of-wounded-dapl-activist-sophia-wilansky-speaks-out/5558665</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3265367008818065359/comments/default/8119207781867131970'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3265367008818065359/comments/default/8119207781867131970'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2016/11/war-crimes-advocate-seeks-job-in-trump.html?showComment=1480040604680#c8119207781867131970' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2016/11/war-crimes-advocate-seeks-job-in-trump.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3265367008818065359' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/3265367008818065359' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1698430837"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="November 24, 2016 at 7:23 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-5522933684810812463</id><published>2016-11-23T14:52:39.167-07:00</published><updated>2016-11-23T14:52:39.167-07:00</updated><title type='text'>Bradford sounds like he would fit in quite nicely ...</title><content type='html'>Bradford sounds like he would fit in quite nicely with the Saudi Monarchy and Hitler&amp;#39;s SS.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;If the world&amp;#39;s population doesn&amp;#39;t soon eradicate these types, we will see them proliferate like a virus and we will be living in a world much like the movie THX 1138&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;http://goldtradercommentsaugust2010.blogspot.com/</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3265367008818065359/comments/default/5522933684810812463'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3265367008818065359/comments/default/5522933684810812463'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2016/11/war-crimes-advocate-seeks-job-in-trump.html?showComment=1479937959167#c5522933684810812463' title=''/><author><name>Cedric Ward</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2016/11/war-crimes-advocate-seeks-job-in-trump.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3265367008818065359' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/3265367008818065359' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1255027356"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="November 23, 2016 at 2:52 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-2316066808024256969</id><published>2016-11-22T15:06:03.968-07:00</published><updated>2016-11-22T15:06:03.968-07:00</updated><title type='text'>pence, priebus and romney strongly suggest a trump...</title><content type='html'>pence, priebus and romney strongly suggest a trump presidency will be &amp;#39;business as usual&amp;#39;, raising the question of the fascist annotated in your article being invited to join the trump regime.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3265367008818065359/comments/default/2316066808024256969'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3265367008818065359/comments/default/2316066808024256969'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2016/11/war-crimes-advocate-seeks-job-in-trump.html?showComment=1479852363968#c2316066808024256969' title=''/><author><name>kirk</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2016/11/war-crimes-advocate-seeks-job-in-trump.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3265367008818065359' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/3265367008818065359' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-888483120"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="November 22, 2016 at 3:06 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-2293397461781060389</id><published>2016-11-21T12:40:38.364-07:00</published><updated>2016-11-21T12:40:38.364-07:00</updated><title type='text'>&amp;quot;&amp;quot;Eventually, people became acclimated t...</title><content type='html'>&amp;quot;&amp;quot;Eventually, people became acclimated to seeing uniformed military personnel patrolling their neighborhood. Now [meaning 2012 in the essay&amp;#39;s timeline] troops are an adjunct to almost all police forces in the country. In many of the areas where much of our burgeoning population of elderly Americans live — Brutus calls them &amp;#39;National Security Zones&amp;#39; — the military is often the only law enforcement agency. Consequently, the military was ideally positioned in thousands of communities to support the coup.&amp;quot;&amp;quot;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;How we arrived in this circumstance is eloquently written about in former Pentagon liaison to the CIA Col L. Fletcher Prouty&amp;#39;s &amp;#39;The Secret Team&amp;#39; (The CIA and its Allies in Control of the United States and the World) where he lays out how the foundation had been laid.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;The entire work can be read online at:&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;https://ratical.org/ratville/JFK/ST/&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;-&lt;br /&gt;</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3265367008818065359/comments/default/2293397461781060389'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3265367008818065359/comments/default/2293397461781060389'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2016/11/war-crimes-advocate-seeks-job-in-trump.html?showComment=1479757238364#c2293397461781060389' title=''/><author><name>Ronald Thomas West</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/16534265281470163729</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='32' height='32' src='//1.bp.blogspot.com/-heL0XqrHVXg/T2ZX1WHX3fI/AAAAAAAAACw/aFV2-C4SvmQ/s220/Ron10.jpg'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2016/11/war-crimes-advocate-seeks-job-in-trump.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3265367008818065359' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/3265367008818065359' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1253045760"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="November 21, 2016 at 12:40 PM"/></entry></feed>